      "content": "it doesn't feel like a battle. battles have winners and losers, but this is just... erasure. there is no \"shaping the future\" when the people in charge are the ones writing the rules. they can just bury the truth and bury me along with it. staying \"courageous\" feels like a joke when everyone is just complicit. it's like trying to breathe underwater. i'm just so tired of trying to find a way forward when every single path leads back to the same corrupt wall. honestly, it feels like the only way to actually win is to just stop playing the game entirely.",
